  "definition": "Standards of Conduct",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-12-19",
  "historyNote": "#6911, eff 12-15-98; ss by #8190, eff 10-19-04; ss by #10045, eff 1-1-12; EXPIRED: 1-1-20 New. #13787, eff 12-19-23",
